2816	    /// changed this doc's summary line and the assertion below from
2817	    /// `Family::TxtProse` to `Family::Binary`, and left the paragraph in place,
2818	    /// describing a rule that no longer existed — through four commits and
2819	    /// seven reviews, including the round that rewrote the identical paragraph
2820	    /// twenty lines above the arm and did not look for its copies.
